msgid "Build an independent Source SDK consumer"
msgstr "构建独立的 Source SDK 消费工程"

msgid ""
"Start a real external C11 application from a reviewed template, then build "
"and run its Native model. This path needs Linux, Python 3.11+, CMake 3.31+, "
"Ninja, a C compiler and Git. The product owns its assembly and application "
"sources; Nexus owns reusable mechanisms. No MCU is flashed by this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"从经过复核的模板创建真实外部 C11 应用，再构建并运行 Native 模型。此路径需要 Linux、Python 3.11+、CMake "
"3.31+、Ninja、C 编译器与 Git。产品拥有装配和应用源码；Nexus 拥有可复用机制。本教程不烧录 MCU。"

msgid "Create and run an application"
msgstr "创建并运行应用"

msgid ""
"Obtain a verified Source SDK and the external [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) checkout. That "
"repository is private and requires its own GitHub access; public Nexus or "
"SDK access does not grant template access. The independent SDK verification "
"below does not require that private repository. Set `NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX` to "
"the installed SDK prefix, `NEXUS_EXAMPLES_DIR` to that checkout and "
"`NEXUS_EXAMPLES_REVISION` to the exact 40-character examples commit recorded"
" with the chosen platform delivery. Set `NEXUS_EXPECTED_REVISION` to the "
"exact 40-character platform commit from that verified delivery. These are "
"separate identities: the template's expected platform revision does not "
"prove which SDK was used. Run these commands from "
"`$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src`; choose a new product directory outside "
"both input checkouts:"
msgstr ""
"取得经过验证的 Source SDK 和外部 [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-"
"examples) checkout。该仓库是私有仓库，需要单独的 GitHub 访问权限；公开 Nexus 或 SDK 的权限不包含模板权限。下方独立"
" SDK 验证不需要该私有仓库。将 `NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX` 设置为已安装 SDK prefix，将 "
"`NEXUS_EXAMPLES_DIR` 设置为该 checkout，将 `NEXUS_EXAMPLES_REVISION` "
"设置为所选平台交付关联的精确 40 位示例 commit。将 `NEXUS_EXPECTED_REVISION` 设置为该已验证交付中的精确 40 "
"位平台 commit。这些是独立身份：模板预期的平台 revision 不证明实际用了哪个 SDK。从 "
"`$NEXUS_SDK_PREFIX/share/nexus/src` 执行以下命令，在两个输入 checkout 外选择新的产品目录："

msgid ""
"Creation reads committed template blobs and their SHA-256 manifest without "
"network access. It rejects a different Git HEAD, changed template bytes, a "
"symlink or an existing destination. It resolves the copied assembly before "
"success; failure removes only its newly created destination. Inspect "
"`.nexus-template.json`: `expected_platform` is the template's lock "
"expectation; `selected_platform` records the selected source or installed "
"SDK, and `validation` records the interpreter, resolver and input bytes "
"actually checked. An installed SDK is checked by its own verifier before its"
" own resolver executes. Creation does not substitute the coordinator "
"checkout's resolver for that selected code."
msgstr ""
"创建过程读取已提交的模板 blob 及其 SHA-256 manifest，不访问网络。不同的 Git HEAD、变化的模板字节、symlink "
"或已有目标目录都会被拒绝。成功前先解析复制后的装配；失败只删除其新创建的目标。检查 `.nexus-"
"template.json`：`expected_platform` 是模板源码锁中的预期；`selected_platform` 记录所选源码或已安装"
" SDK，`validation` 记录实际检查所用的解释器、解析器和输入字节。已安装 SDK "
"先由自身校验器检查，再执行自身解析器。创建过程不会用协调工具所在 checkout 的解析器替换所选代码。"

msgid ""
"Copy and run the printed configure, build and Native test commands. They "
"already contain the selected SDK path and expected revision, including safe "
"quoting for paths with spaces. `--json` instead returns the same command "
"argument arrays in the origin record. Creation validates and generates "
"configuration; those later commands still have to run before a build or test"
" can be claimed."
msgstr ""
"复制并运行输出的 configure、build 和 Native 测试命令。这些命令已包含所选 SDK 路径和预期 "
"revision，并对含空格的路径进行了安全引用。`--json` "
"则在来源记录中返回相同命令的参数数组。创建过程验证并生成配置；只有实际执行后续命令，才能声称构建或测试已完成。"

msgid ""
"The generated product contains `CMakeLists.txt`, `assembly.toml`, `main.c` "
"and `README.md`. A successful Native test prints `Nexus starter: transfer "
"settled; platform stopped` and exits zero. Native UART is a software model, "
"not a host serial port. The example uses strong factory references, provides"
" request storage, observes settlement and stops the platform. A timeout is "
"an error, not permission to release outstanding storage."
msgstr ""
"生成的产品包含 `CMakeLists.txt`、`assembly.toml`、`main.c` 与 `README.md`。Native "
"测试成功会输出 `Nexus starter: transfer settled; platform stopped` 并以零退出。Native "
"UART 是软件模型，不是 host 串口。示例使用 strong factory 引用，提供请求存储，观察结清并停止平台。timeout "
"是错误，不能授权释放未结清存储。"

msgid ""
"For a development checkout, select `--source /absolute/path/to/nexus` "
"instead of `--sdk-prefix`. The emitted configure command selects that "
"same checkout through `NEXUS_SOURCE`; it does not qualify an installed "
"SDK. The two source selectors are mutually exclusive. Without either "
"selector, creation uses its current checkout explicitly. Select a "
"`qiming` or `sky` template whose pinned manifest selects a maintained "
"F407 part and Board. The emitted MCU configure command includes the "
"selected platform's ARM toolchain file; Native selections do not receive "
"an ARM toolchain. Use the locked ARM compiler. An MCU link is software "
"evidence; board bring-up and electrical verification remain separate."
msgstr ""
"开发 checkout 使用 `--source /absolute/path/to/nexus`，而不是 `--sdk-prefix`。生成的 "
"configure 命令通过 `NEXUS_SOURCE` 选择同一个 checkout；它不验证已安装 "
"SDK。这两个源码选择器互斥。不指定时，创建器显式使用当前 checkout。选择固定 manifest 中实际引用受维护 F407 型号和 "
"Board 的 `qiming` 或 `sky` 模板。生成的 MCU configure 命令包含所选平台的 ARM toolchain "
"文件；Native 选择不接收 ARM toolchain。使用锁定的 ARM 编译器。MCU 链接是软件证据；开发板启动和电气验证分别执行。"

msgid ""
"If creation rejects configuration, read the reported file, key and "
"constraint. Check the selected SDK/interface and fixed template revision "
"first. A template correction requires a newly reviewed commit, not edits to "
"pinned template bytes. After successful creation, edit the product's "
"authored assembly and configure again; use the [configuration and ownership "
"guide](../guides/developer-workflow.md) to inspect reviewed bindings. Do not"
" repair generated files or suppress a rejected selection. Keep product "
"sources; remove only your own build output after retaining needed logs."
msgstr ""
"创建因配置被拒绝时，阅读报告中的文件、key 与约束。先检查所选 "
"SDK／接口和固定模板版本。模板修正需要新的已复核提交，不能修改固定模板字节。成功创建后，编辑产品 authored "
"装配并重新配置；通过[配置与所有权指南](../guides/developer-workflow.md)检查已复核 "
"binding。不要修补生成文件或压制拒绝。保留产品源码；保存必要日志后只删除自有构建输出。"

msgid "Upgrade an existing product"
msgstr "升级现有产品"

msgid ""
"Select a newly qualified Source SDK and its reviewed 40-character platform "
"commit. Set `NEXUS_NEXT_SDK_PREFIX` and `NEXUS_NEXT_REVISION` to those "
"inputs; use a new build directory outside the product and SDK:"
msgstr ""
"选择新完成资格验证的 Source SDK 及其已复核的 40 位平台 commit。将 `NEXUS_NEXT_SDK_PREFIX` 和 "
"`NEXUS_NEXT_REVISION` 设置为这两个输入；在产品和 SDK 目录之外使用新的构建目录："

msgid ""
"Keep the product's authored sources and `.nexus-template.json`; that file "
"records its template origin, not the current SDK selection. Do not reuse the"
" old CMake cache across SDK prefixes. Two source revisions may advertise the"
" same semantic version; the explicit source pin rejects a different "
"revision. A pin mismatch is a configuration error: preserve its diagnostic "
"and select the reviewed inputs. Review the product's `find_package()` "
"version requirement and changed assembly constraints; do not automatically "
"loosen that version requirement. Rerun the product's required Native tests "
"and MCU links before accepting the upgrade. An older SDK's results do not "
"qualify the new SDK, and a successful link does not qualify physical "
"hardware."
msgstr ""
"保留产品的 authored 源码和 `.nexus-template.json`；该文件记录模板来源，不表示当前选择的 SDK。不同 SDK "
"prefix 之间不要复用旧的 CMake cache。两个源码 revision 可能声明相同的语义版本；显式源码 pin 会拒绝不同的 "
"revision。pin 不匹配属于配置错误：保留诊断并选择已复核的输入。复核产品的 `find_package()` "
"版本要求及变化的装配约束；不要自动放宽该版本要求。接受升级前，重新执行产品要求的 Native 测试和 MCU 链接。旧 SDK 的结果不能建立新 "
"SDK 的资格；链接成功也不能建立物理硬件资格。"

msgid "Source interface epoch 2"
msgstr "源码接口 epoch 2"

msgid "The current `0.2.1` development snapshot uses factory/source interface epoch `2`; its installed SDK manifest uses schema `2` independently. Select the exact reviewed commit, regenerate and rebuild all callers, faces/ops, generated code, providers and components together. Current interface admission rejects epoch-1 SDKs; old objects must be rebuilt. `--development-fixture` never bypasses interface checks or permits mixed binaries. No existing tag is moved."
msgstr "当前 `0.2.1` 开发快照的 factory／source interface epoch 为 `2`，已安装 SDK manifest 独立使用 schema `2`。选择经审核的精确提交，重新生成，并一起重编所有调用者、face／ops、生成代码、provider 和组件。当前接口准入拒绝 epoch 1 SDK，旧对象必须重编；`--development-fixture` 不绕过接口检查，也不允许混合二进制对象。现有标签均不移动。"

msgid "Direct ADC group `request.frames` access must become `request.output.frames`. Prefer `nx_adc_group_prepare()` for raw requests so it sets the RAW discriminant; paired results use `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()`. Check `results_kind` before reading the union. There is no old-field shadow or inferred layout. Follow the [migration guide](../guides/migration.md#rebuild-for-source-interface-epoch-2) and [compatibility contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) before accepting a new SDK; a matching semantic version alone is insufficient."
msgstr "ADC group 的直接 `request.frames` 访问必须改为 `request.output.frames`。raw 请求优先使用 `nx_adc_group_prepare()` 设置 RAW discriminant，paired 结果使用 `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()`。读取 union 前检查 `results_kind`，不提供旧字段影子或推测布局。接受新 SDK 前遵循[迁移指南](../guides/migration.md#rebuild-for-source-interface-epoch-2)与[兼容性合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)；仅语义版本一致不足以接纳。"

msgid "Maintainer: verify the complete SDK consumer"
msgstr "维护者：验证完整 SDK 消费"

msgid ""
"To verify the examples repository itself, use its maintained "
"`scripts/local_ci.py` and bilingual `docs/local-ci.md` at the fixed examples"
" revision. The default scope runs the complete mapped local workflow from a "
"new output directory; `--scope native`, `--scope arm` and preset selection "
"remain partial scopes. Its explicit `--nexus-source` must match the examples"
" lock. An optional `--installed-sdk` must match the same pin. This workflow "
"does not turn a blocked hosted CI run into a passed one, nor establish "
"physical HIL."
msgstr ""
"验证示例仓库本身时，使用固定示例版本中的维护入口 `scripts/local_ci.py` 和双语 `docs/local-ci.md`。默认 "
"scope 从新输出目录执行完整映射的本地工作流；`--scope native`、`--scope arm` 和 preset 选择仍是局部范围。显式"
" `--nexus-source` 必须匹配示例锁定版本；可选 `--installed-sdk` 也必须匹配同一版本。该工作流不会把受阻的托管 CI "
"改为通过，也不建立物理 HIL 资格。"

msgid ""
"The remaining sections are platform maintenance tasks. First obtain the "
"[fixed source and recursive dependencies](../guides/source-checkout.md). Run"
" from that checkout, not an arbitrary default branch. The maintained "
"contract below checks independent C and C++ consumption, relocation and "
"package identity."
msgstr ""
"以下各节是平台维护任务。先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md)。从该检出执行，不使用任意默认分支。以下已维护合同检查独立 C／C++ 消费、搬移与包身份。"

msgid ""
"Work from the repository root with the pinned recursive dependencies "
"initialized. Keep output outside the source checkout. This exact test calls "
"the production packager and maintained consumer template, moves the prefix "
"into a path containing spaces, configures independent projects, builds both "
"languages and runs the Native executables:"
msgstr ""
"从仓库根目录执行，先初始化锁定的递归依赖。输出置于源码 checkout "
"外。下面这个确切测试调用生产打包器和维护中的消费者模板，将前缀搬移到含空格的路径，配置独立工程，构建两种语言并运行 Native 可执行文件："

msgid ""
"Success is a nonempty unittest execution ending in `OK`, with exit code "
"zero. The test's temporary directory is removed automatically. Failure "
"preserves its actual command diagnostic; do not count a missing compiler as "
"a passed consumer. The fixture deliberately packages a development snapshot "
"and explicitly opts in; this validates consumption, not a publishable "
"software candidate."
msgstr ""
"成功要求非空 unittest 执行以 `OK` "
"结束，退出码为零。测试自动清理临时目录。失败保留实际命令诊断；编译器缺失不能记作消费者通过。夹具明确打包开发快照并显式允许消费；这验证消费流程，不建立可发布软件候选。"

msgid ""
"The complete consumer is maintained in the production verifier rather than "
"copied into this page. These literal inputs are the same templates exercised"
" by the test:"
msgstr "完整消费者由生产验证器维护，本页不复制实现。以下真实输入就是该测试执行的模板："

msgid ""
"Maintained explicit host-test/F4 consumer preparation; template code is not "
"a shell command."
msgstr "受维护的显式 host-test／F4 消费者准备；模板代码不是 shell 命令。"

msgid "Maintainer: prepare a publishable prefix"
msgstr "维护者：准备可发布前缀"

msgid "From a clean, committed checkout, prepare the exact dependencies for the [complete maintained consumer plan](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py), then choose a new owned output path. This profile includes explicit Native support, the FreeRTOS supplier and the network, TLS, MQTT, MCUboot and optional ST USB suppliers. The ARM consumer images still state their own selected backend; a supplier in the package does not prove its scheduler or hardware has executed. Preparation may use the network; export and verification use the pinned local bytes."
msgstr "从干净、已提交的检出准备[完整维护消费者计划](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/consumer_profiles.py)所需的精确依赖，再选择新的自有输出路径。该 profile 显式包含 Native 支撑、FreeRTOS 供应方及网络、TLS、MQTT、MCUboot 和可选 ST USB 供应方。ARM 消费镜像仍各自声明所选后端；包内存在供应方不证明调度器或硬件已经执行。准备可联网，导出与验证使用固定的本地字节。"

msgid "For a small bare-metal firmware package, omit those profile switches when exporting to a different prefix. The default intentionally has no Native models or optional supplier payloads. Its package-integrity check remains valid, but the verifier for that complete maintained plan requires the full profile above. It never silently skips a consumer to admit a smaller package."
msgstr "小型裸机固件可在另一 prefix 导出时省略这些 profile 选项。默认包不包含 Native 模型或可选供应方。其包完整性检查仍有效，但完整维护计划的验证器要求上述完整 profile，不会静默跳过消费者来接纳精简包。"

msgid ""
"Move the entire prefix, including its identity and licenses, before "
"consumption. The [Source SDK contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) "
"defines version and interface epoch checks. Missing, extra, modified or "
"symlinked payload files reject configuration. A package made with "
"`--development-fixture` remains nonpublishable and requires "
"`NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON` in its consumer. Never use that opt-in "
"to bypass release qualification."
msgstr ""
"消费前搬移整个前缀，包括身份和许可。[Source SDK 合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)定义版本与接口 "
"epoch 检查。内容文件缺失、额外、修改或符号链接文件会拒绝配置。使用 `--development-fixture` "
"生成的包保持不可发布，消费者必须显式设置 `NEXUS_ALLOW_SOURCE_SDK_FIXTURE=ON`。不得用该选项绕过发布资格。"

msgid ""
"The SDK retains the complete recursive CMSIS-Core `Include` tree and its "
"Apache-2.0 `LICENSE` from the locked official v6.4.0 source. It does not "
"include the entire CMSIS repository or automatically enable CMSIS-RTOS, "
"CMSIS-Driver, DSP or NN. These private implementation headers are distinct "
"from the public `Nexus::Core` mechanisms. Device/startup and HAL/LL remain "
"separately locked; older bundled GigaDevice Core files retain their original"
" bytes and notices without becoming the selected common Core. Verify the "
"complete moved prefix, not a manually copied subset of headers. This "
"dependency update does not expand supported chips or replace current-source "
"compiler and consumer evidence."
msgstr ""
"SDK 保留锁定的官方 v6.4.0 来源中完整递归 CMSIS-Core `Include` 树及其 Apache-2.0 "
"`LICENSE`。它不包含整个 CMSIS 仓库，也不自动启用 CMSIS-RTOS、CMSIS-Driver、DSP 或 NN。这些私有实现头与公共"
" `Nexus::Core` 中性机制不同。Device/startup 和 HAL/LL 仍分别锁定；GigaDevice 原包中的旧 Core "
"文件保留原始字节及通知，但不作为选中的共享 Core 来源。应验证移位后的完整 "
"prefix，而不是手动复制的头文件子集。这项依赖更新不扩大芯片支持，也不替代当前源码的编译器与 consumer 执行证据。"

msgid ""
"The formal installed-prefix verifier requires the locked ARM compiler on "
"`PATH` in addition to host tools. It builds Native C/C++ and the maintained "
"MCU consumers:"
msgstr ""
"正式安装前缀验证器除主机工具外，还要求锁定的 ARM 编译器位于 `PATH`。它构建 Native C/C++ 和维护中的 MCU 消费者："

msgid ""
"Check `verification.json`, every recorded exit code, Native runtime results,"
" MCU ELF/BIN/map and resource reports. MCU linking does not execute "
"hardware. The verifier's output is owned; an unrelated existing directory "
"rejects replacement. The SDK prefix and output must be canonical paths "
"without symlink aliases, and neither may contain the other. A rejected path "
"leaves SDK bytes and previous reports untouched; read the failure diagnostic"
" on stderr. An admitted owned output is cleared before the next attempt. "
"Remove only outputs you created after retaining required evidence."
msgstr ""
"检查 `verification.json`、每个记录的退出码、Native 运行结果、MCU ELF/BIN/map 与资源报告。MCU "
"链接不执行硬件。验证器输出为专有目录；不相关的已有目录会拒绝替换。SDK "
"前缀与输出必须是没有符号链接别名的规范路径，且两者均不得包含另一方。路径被拒绝时，SDK 字节和既有报告保持不变；失败诊断写入 "
"stderr。通过准入的专有输出会在下一次尝试前清空。仅在保留所需证据后删除自己创建的输出。"

msgid "Choose a product assembly"
msgstr "选择产品装配"

msgid ""
"Products keep `assembly.toml`, `main`, workers and private Board data in an "
"external repository. They consume `Nexus::Platform` through "
"`nexus_add_firmware()`; the helper does not generate an application or start"
" a scheduler. Use the [assembly "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md) to select reviewed "
"bindings and the [factory explanation](../explanation/factory.md) to obtain "
"faces. Public product examples live in [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)."
msgstr ""
"产品在外部仓库维护 `assembly.toml`、`main`、执行任务和私有 Board 数据。通过 `nexus_add_firmware()` "
"消费 "
"`Nexus::Platform`；该辅助函数不生成应用或启动调度器。使用[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md)选择复核绑定，通过[factory"
" 说明](../explanation/factory.md)取得接口面。公开产品示例位于 [nexus-"
"examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples)。"

msgid ""
"![Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer "
"verification](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证](../assets/diagrams/source-sdk-consumer.svg)"

msgid ""
"Source SDK preparation, relocation and independent consumer verification"
msgstr "Source SDK 准备、搬移与独立消费者验证"

msgid ""
"FIG-10 shows the current software consumption flow. Runtime and MCU link "
"evidence remain separate from [physical "
"qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)."
msgstr ""
"FIG-10 表示当前软件消费流程。Runtime 与 MCU "
"链接证据和[物理资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)分别记录。"
